# Agent prompts and internal working notes — kept out of the product repo.
# These are session scaffolding, not deliverables, and they date badly: the previous
# audit prompt asserted live logged-in accounts were available when they were not, and
# that false premise survived in-repo long enough to misdirect a later session.
*-prompt.md
docs/completion-todo.md

# Claude Code workspace config (hooks, local settings, task locks). Session scaffolding,
# like the agent prompts above — useful on one machine, meaningless in the product repo.
.claude/
